#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:326
msgid ""
":func:`protocol.poll` is back. v5.0.0 removed it when the protocol task "
"moved to the timer; it returns as an explicit way to drive the task for "
"custom transports. Nothing else changed — scripts that never called it are "
"unaffected."
msgstr ""
":func:`protocol.poll` a revenit. v5.0.0 l-a eliminat când sarcina de "
"protocol a trecut pe temporizator; revine ca o modalitate explicită de a "
"acționa sarcina pentru transporturi personalizate. Nimic altceva nu s-a "
"schimbat — scripturile care nu l-au apelat niciodată nu sunt afectate."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:331
msgid ""
"*Commit:* `c00c215f9 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/c00c215f9>`__"
